# Generated content (content/{backstory,atlas,reference,foes}) is fanned in from
# the vault + ironledger by ./sync.sh and is NOT committed — but it is excluded
# via .git/info/exclude, NOT here. Reason: Quartz honors .gitignore when
# discovering content, so listing these here would make the build skip them.
# info/exclude keeps them out of git while leaving them visible to the build.
# (content/index.md is the hand-authored home page and IS tracked.)
